('a1-u06-l03-q04','a1-u06-l03','multiple_choice','The bank is ___ the café and the shop.','[{"id":"a","text":"between"},{"id":"b","text":"behind of"},{"id":"c","text":"next"}]','a','Between is used for a position in the middle of two things.',4);
